  "I read an article, someone had kindly posted on an Internet
  newsgroup, describing how to send  A ONE DOLLAR BILL TO ONLY
  FIVE PEOPLE AND MAKE $50,000 IN CASH WITHIN ABOUT 4 WEEKS!!"

  ____________________________________________________________

  OK.   Here's my try. I just sent $5 to five different people
  around the world.

  Why should I do it?   Here's what I think :

  I don't typically trust "get rich schemes".   We've all seen
  them on late night television -and we've all tuned them out.
  The difference with this was it was only $5.00 --the cost of
  a lunch, and a quick turnover.

  What if nobody responds?      Well,  I am responding already
  -- other people did too.   And,  even if the amount returned
  is not as great as folks tell us -- even if it's only $2000,
  $1000,  or  even  $500   --  I would  just put in  $5 on the
  possibilities.  And, think,  what if it IS true and  $50,000
  comes in about four weeks.

  OK, so maybe $50,000 in cash is a tough amount to reach, but
  it doesn't keep me from trying.

  Well,  I don't know about you  folks,  but I will do it,  so
  plenty of other people must be doing it too.   I think  they
  are helping themselves and others.

  The remainder of this article is a message from someone else
  who knows better how it works.
  ____________________________________________________________


  I read an article,  someone had kindly posted on an Internet
  newsgroup, describing how to send  A ONE DOLLAR BILL TO ONLY
  FIVE PEOPLE AND MAKE $50,000 IN CASH WITHIN ABOUT 4 WEEKS!!!

  Of course,  I thought  this was rediculous  at first.  Then,
  after a short period,  I saw another one in a newsgroup I go
  to a lot.   The more  I thought about it, the more  I became
  curious.  I thought,    "I have already heard of such things
  --  but on the Internet ?!?!?    Maybe this  is legitimate!"
  Besides,  what's $5,00 ?   I decided  that even  if I had to
  throw $5 into the fire, I wouldn't mind it much, and gave it
  a try.  After all, I needed a LOT more than five dollars.

  I carefully  followed  the instructions  and then waited  to
  watch the money come in  ... prepared maybe to receive about
  $1000 to $1500 in cash or so ...

  Two weeks later,  I began receiving money.   It  was  indeed
  unbelievable!   What a welcome surprise when those envelopes
  kept coming!!   I knew what they were  as soon as  I saw the
  return addresses from people all over the world -- most from
  the U.S., but some from Canada, even some from Europe, Japan
  and Australia!  I tell you, THAT WAS EXCITING !!

  Soon,  hundreds, and then thousands of dollars began to roll
  in like an  avalanche!   So -- how much did I get in total ?
  $1,000 ?   $5,000 ?  Not even !!!    Within  4 weeks,  I had
  received a  total  of  $32,445 !   My  bank  account changed
  its "-"  into  a big "+"(++++)!!!  I bought myself a car and
  things I wanted for a long time for my wife and kids!

  There is not any reason why the same shouldn't happen to you.
  If you're not interested then don't participate.


  It seems to work for other folks:

  * Mike Walsh          -- claims that he recd nearly  $47,000
  * Markus Valppu       -- says he made $57,883  in four weeks
  * Dave Manning        -- claims $53,664  in same amt of time
  * Dan Shepstone       -- says it was  only  $17,000  for him
  * Oliver Arcadipane   -- claims  $32,445  within  four weeks

  Do I know these folks? No, but when I read how they say they
  did it, it made sense to me. Enough sense, that I'm taking a
  similar chance with $5 of my own money.  Not a big chance, I
  admit  -- but one  with incredible potential,  because $5 is
  all anyone ever risks -- PERIOD.   That's all  Mike, Markus,
  Dave, Dan, or Oliver needed,  yet their $5  netted them tens
  of thousands of dollars each.

  So, how do you do it, you ask?  It's truly simple.  Go ahead
  and get a printout of this information:


  STEP 1

        Write the following on five separate pieces of paper:

        a)      a name, address, and e-mail

        b)      name of the newsgroup where you learned of it

        c)      the words  "PLEASE ADD ME TO YOUR LIST"
                (You are not just sending a dollar to someone;
                 you are paying for a legitimate service.)

        d)      as a courtesy,  also  write the position their
                name was in:  "You were in position 3"


  STEP 2

        Now,  fold each piece of paper around a $1 dollar bill
        (no checks or money orders),  and  deliver them on the
        way to the following five people.   Folding the  paper
        around the bill will ensure its arrival to an intended
        recipient.  This step is important.

        ******************************************************
        NAMES LIST    NAMES LIST    NAMES LIST    NAMES LIST
        ******************************************************

        ! !  HONESTY IS WHAT MAKES THIS WORK FOR YOU TOO   ! !

        1.  Nir Levi,
            PO BOX 342
            Yavne, ISRAEL

        2.  Landon
            #1 Lakeway Drive
            Conroe, Tx 77304  USA

        3.  Olivier Arcadipane
            237 rue Francois Andre
            7390 Quaregnon       BELGIUM

        4.  BTech
            5641 Apgar St
            Houston, Texas 77032  USA
        
        5.  Hugo Desmeules,
            6100 Deacon apt 1-P
            Montreal, Quebec, H3S 2V6, CANADA   
        ......................................................


  STEP 3

        Now,  listen  carefully  -- here's where you get  YOUR
        MONEY COMING.  Look at the list of five people; remove
        the  top name from the list,  and move everyone up one
        position. This way #5 becomes #4  and  so on. Put your
        name,  address, postal code, and COUNTRY  in the fifth
        one on the list using a simple text editor.
  

  STEP 4

        Now,  take this revised article  with your name on the
        list  and  repost it to as many  newsgroups as you can
        -- try for  more than  200 newsgroups.   There are  at
        least  17,000  newsgroups,  so it shouldn't be hard to
        find that many. Remember, the more groups you post to,
        and the bigger the newsgroup is,  the more people will
        see your article  and the greater probability they may
        send you cash!

        If you wish to be anonymous,  you may use a psuedonym.
        -- call yourself "The Boss" or something  -- whatever,
        just be sure the address is correct.

        Give a catchy title  --  something like  "EA$Y MONEY",
        "FA$T CA$H", "NEED CASH TO PAY OFF DEBTS?".   The more
        posts, the more money you may get  --  and, of course,
        the  more money others on the list  probably make too.
        REMEMBER,  BE HONEST AND  EVERYONE MAY MAKE MONEY FROM
        THIS EASY CONCEPT.  You can reap the benefits, believe
        me !!

  Now, hypothetically, here is why it should work:

  -     Of every 200 posts I made, I received 5 responses. Yes
        only 5.   You could make $5  for every  200 posts with
        your name at #5.

  -     Each person who sends you  $1  now makes an additional
        200 postings with your name at #4.  ie.  1000 postings
        On average,  therefore,  50  people could send you  $1
        your name at #4.  $50

  -     Your  50 new agents make  200 postings  each with your
        name at #3 -or- 10,000 postings.   Average return  500
        people = $500.  They make 200 postings  each with your
        name at #2  =  100,000 postings =  5,000 return at  $1
        each = $5,000.

