  Some people have said,  "What happens if no one sends me any
  money?"   Big Deal -so you lose $5 -but what are the chances
  of that happening? Are you willing to try on the possibility
  of such BIG money as 50,000.00 $$$$ ???? -- all just for the
  microscopic amount of five separate dollars?   Just think of
  all the  new Internet users that join every day !!!

  So, that's it. Pretty simple sounding stuff, huh?  There are
  millions of people surfing the net every day,  all day,  all
  over the world.  You know that -- you've seen the stories in
  the paper.  There  are  millions  of new  net surfers  every
  month !!!  This is the great plus of the Internet  -- people
  all over the world can hear you  and will listen if you talk
  reasonably.  If this wasn't the Internet,  and was a smaller
  circle of people, the possibilities would be different -- if
  the amount of money had to be  bigger,  it wouldn't succeed.
  But  here,  on the  Internet,  it is a giant village,  where
  thousands of members join every day!  One can hardly lose !!

  So pay off your bills and debts.   HOLD OFF ON THOSE LOTTERY
