Currently there's a series of keyboards known variously as the LK411 and
LK461.
These keyboards sport the LK401 style layout.  Theoretically, they
require no
drivers to function under Windows NT.  The LK411, for example functions
fine
when running the eXcursion X server on systems that load the standard
keyboard
