Well, based on your drawing, your on the right track. The CSR address is right 
(1772150) so...Make sure if this is a big box microvax BA123 cab. that you use 
only the A-B slots thru slot 4, but don,t miss any..You must have a board, 
memory or device or a grant card in the slots to propagate the grant signals.
If this is a BA123 check the RX50 jumper on the dist. board in the drive bay.
Make sure this is in if you have the RX50 floppy drives installed.
Your rd53 may not be formatted for RQDX3, this will also give you this error.

You can see a blick in the activity light on the boot just before the error, 
if this is your only problem.
Hope this helps .







