Get RZSPINUP.EXE from gatekeeper.dec.com (should be there somewhere),
find a PC with an Adaptec and ASPI drivers loaded. Hookup disk, run program.
That's it.

Remember that the RZ55 was designed (by Micropolis BTW) to work with DEC
systems, and not with Suns. DECs send the START UNIT (standard SCSI BTW...)

My IPC was quite happy with it once I set the mode page correctly.

(and don't use so many ! ...)

Wilko



