to estimated) SPEC numbers and a shipping date, then from the time of
that date onwards I think it is reasonable to consider it when making
such statements as "the fastest" etc. Otherwise claiming you're the
fastest when some of your results are not up on SPEC's Web server
doesn't make any sense.

