This is a non-issue.  OS Threads are not needed to get good MP
performance.  HP has not been having any problems without a
OS based threads solution so far.  HP-UX will have threads to
be more "standard", but OS threads are not needed for good MP
performance (ask Sybase/Oracle/Informix).

