>
Well, HP with only 4 processors and 2GB of main memory was able to
get within 20% of a DEC 8400 running 12 300MHz processors and 4GB
of main memory!  So using 3 times fewer processors and 1/2 the main
memory, HP got within 20%.  Price performance wise I would imagine
the HP would win hands down.  Cpu for cpu HP again dominates.
 
