on SUNs, the following works on dtterms and shelltools
under both olwm and dtwm:
alias cd 'chdir \!* ; set LABEL = {$HOST}:$cwd ; echo -n "^[]l $LABEL
^[\"'

(where ^[ is the escape key...can be enter by typing control-v followed
by the Esc key.)

