If your machine has a 3.5 inch disk there is no way to add a PCI card.  If
it has a 2.5 inch disk the PCI riser has a PCI expansion slot such that you can
install a short PCI card parallel to the motherboard.

> Is there some sort of disk controller on the motherboard? I see a small
