Kevin Routh (routh@ix.netcom.com) wrote:
: I have a DEC model VR-299-DA monitor for which I need specs. Please post
: or e-mail specs if you have them. Also, it has three BNC color inputs on
: the back (no H or V or Sync). Can this monitor be used in any of the
: common SVGA modes?

: Thanks,

