They are on the back, next to the scsi connection.  They are:
(the jumpers are counted going *away* from the scsi connector)

RZ55, RZ56 RZ57, and RZ58 Drive SCSI ID

SCSI ID	3	2	1
0	Out	Out	Out
1	Out	Out	In
2	Out	In	Out
3	Out	In	In
4	In	Out	Out
5	In	Out	In
6	In	In	Out
7	In	In	In

