I'd venture to guess that your machine is not configured to use DNS.
Have a look at /etc/svc.conf -- This file controls where (local files,
yp maps, dns/bind) the system gets certain information (alias, group,
passwd, hosts, etc). Look for a line that begins with the word 'hosts'
and make sure the word 'bind' appears on that line.  For example:

hosts=bind,local

