what Microvax implementations actually support it.

I believe that at least some technical details about power-fail recovery
can be found in some editions of "VMS Internals and Data Structures".
My edition (for VMS 4.4) certainly has some information, though it
mainly applies to the original VAX 11/7xx series, and doesn't mention
the Microvax.  The details of power-fail recovery vary widely even
among the older VAXen.

Tim. (shoppa@triumf.ca)



