|>to the KDA50's presence ? BTW the RA81 is know good, I can hook it up to 
|> another VAX and it runs fine...
|>

Apart from missing grant cards (and possibly dead boards) you have done all you
should need to do. The only other thing I can remember is that you must wire
the SDI cables via the rear panel connectors (on a BA23) otherwise it does not
work (i.e. you cannot go directly from KDA50 to RA81, although you'd find it
hard to do this anyway with an RA81).

